{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o048a","title":"刘备失下邳来投曹操","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o048a-account","label":"正文","text":"吕布袭取下邳，刘备来投曹操；程昱建议早图刘备，曹操以招纳英雄为由拒绝。","evidence":["wudi-e-o048a-q"]},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o011a-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"刘备与袁术相持时，曹豹内应吕布，下邳失守，刘备妻子被虏，刘备转军海西。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o011a-q"]},{"id":"xianzhu-a-p009-yingxiong","label":"《英雄记》","text":"《英雄记》记张飞欲杀曹豹，曹豹部众招吕布，张飞败走；与正文的守城叙述分列。","evidence":["xianzhu-q-p009-yingxiong"]},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o013a-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"刘备还小沛重聚万余兵，吕布出兵击败他；刘备归曹操，获厚遇并为豫州牧。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o013a-q"]},{"id":"chengguo-a-d39ee7b7aa1f72659b7b","label":"正文","text":"刘备失徐州来归太祖","evidence":["chengguo-q-705e3235b353e56fbd21"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0088","role":"袭取","evidence":["wudi-e-o048a-q"]},{"person":"liu-bei","role":"来投","evidence":["wudi-e-o048a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0101","role":"进言","evidence":["wudi-e-o048a-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"拒绝杀备","evidence":["wudi-e-o048a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0102","role":"迎吕布","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o011a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0367","role":"据《英雄记》守下邳败走","evidence":["xianzhu-q-p009-yingxiong"]}],"place":{"text":"下邳","evidence":["wudi-e-o048a-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安元年","year":196,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o048a-q","wudi-q-o040","wudi-q-b-16a5462151b1cfe5142d"],"chronology":"wudi-y196","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o040","basis":"建安元年","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,286,"O048a"],"order":131}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0088","name":"吕布","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0101","name":"程昱","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0102","name":"曹豹","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0367","name":"张飞","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-705e3235b353e56fbd21","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-e9401b31a90b17c74409","layer":"original","quote":"刘备失徐州，来归太祖","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":33,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":10,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o048a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-76c1b3b4753740d2a425","layer":"original","quote":"吕布袭刘备，取下邳〖7〗，备来奔。程昱说公曰：“观刘备有雄才而甚得众心，终不为人下；不如早图之〖8〗。”公曰：“方今收英雄时也；杀一人而失天下之心，不可！”","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":285,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-16a5462151b1cfe5142d","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-16a5462151b1cfe5142d","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗建安元年：公元 196 年。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":264,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-df2756e12f4ac1fef3c4","start":0,"end":17,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o040","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c71d10ef121af30ac6b7","layer":"original","quote":"建安元年春正月〖1〗，太祖军临武平〖2〗。袁术所置陈相袁嗣，降。太祖将迎天子，诸将或疑；荀彧、程昱劝之。乃遣曹洪将兵西迎。卫将军董承与袁术将苌奴拒险〖3〗，洪不得进。汝南、颍川黄巾何仪、刘辟、黄邵、何曼等〖4〗，众各数万。初应袁术，又附孙坚〖5〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":258,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":124,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o011a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-50264f958d931f9c772f","layer":"original","quote":"先主与术相持经月，吕布乘虚袭下邳；下邳守将曹豹反，间迎布〖11〗，布虏先主妻子。先主转军海西。﹝二﹞","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":41,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":50,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o013a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-2bcaabf007ae7b6068f2","layer":"original","quote":"先主还小沛，﹝一﹞复合兵得万余人。吕布恶之，自出兵攻先主。先主败走归曹公〖1〗，曹公厚遇之〖2〗，以为豫州牧。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-p009-yingxiong","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-ef8a371cd9d1306e2091","layer":"pei","quote":"备留张飞，守下邳；引兵，与袁术战于淮阴石亭，更有胜负。陶谦故将曹豹，在下邳，张飞欲杀之。豹众坚营自守，使人招吕布。布取下邳，张飞败走。","attribution":"《英雄记》","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":57,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-b611f3a7f8dac2f2633d","start":11,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
